  "english": "[October] 7. Thursday. Tone 1 [ADZ]. Saint Sophia and her three daughters. Fathers [Hymn] Tone 6 [GK]: \"Who in the battle of the laws\" (Որք ի մարտի նօրինացն).\n9. Saturday. Tone 2 [BDZ]. Of the sons and grandsons of the Illuminator.\n10. Sunday. Tone 3 [BK]. Fourth [Sunday]. Dismissal Hymn [Hambartsi] Tone 3 [BK]: \"The Resurrection of Christ\" (Ըզյարութիւն Քրիստոսի). Barekendan of the Catechumens.\n11. Monday. Tone 4 [DTS]. Fast of the Catechumens. Fathers [Hymn] for the Fast Tone 3 [BK]: \"The voice of the children\" (Մանկանցն զձայն).\n[February] 14. Thursday. Tone 8 [DK]. Fast. Presentation of the Lord [Tyarnndaraj]. [Mlar - abbreviation/indicator].\n3. Sunday. Tone 8 [DK]. Great Barekendan [of Lent]. See also the others according to their order in the First Volume.\nApril...\n[April] 7. Sunday. Tone 2 [BDZ]. Sixth [Sunday]. Feast of the Annunciation of the Holy Virgin.\n[April] 21. Sunday. Tone 1 [ADZ]. Easter. Day of the Resurrection of Jesus Christ. See according to the order in the First Volume.\nMay\n[May] 30. Thursday. Tone 8 [DK]. Ascension of Christ. See according to the order in the First Volume.\nJune\n[June] 9. Sunday. Tone 2 [AK]. Coming of the Holy Spirit [Pentecost]. Barekendan of the Elias fast.\n[June] 16. Sunday. Tone 1 [ADZ]. First [Sunday]. Beginning of the Sundays of the Resurrection. Look here for the Fathers [Hymns] of the Sundays.\n[June] 30. Sunday. Tone 7 [DZ]. Third [Sunday]. Fathers [Hymn] Tone 2 [AK]: \"Who didst come for salvation\" (Որ եկիր ի փրկութիւն). Dismissal Hymn [Hambartsi] Tone 7 [DZ]: \"Co-glorious\" (Փառաբանակից).\nJuly\n[July] 7. Sunday. Tone 6 [GK]. Fourth [Sunday]. Fathers [Hymn] Tone 2 [BDZ]: \"Who didst descend from heaven\" (Որ ի յերկնից իջեր).\n[July] 21. Sunday. Tone 3 [BK]. Sixth [Sunday]. Fathers [Hymn] Tone 3 [BK]: \"Who of the heavenly hosts\" (Որ յերկնային զինուորութեանցդ). Barekendan of the Fast of Vardavar.\n[July] 28. Sunday. Tone 2 [BDZ]. Vardavar [Transfiguration]. The privilege of eating meat is three weeks. See the First Volume until Friday of the second week, and on Saturday come here; but look here for the Fathers [Hymns] of the Sundays.\nAugust\n4. Sunday. Tone 2 [AK]. Second [Sunday]. Fathers [Hymn] Tone 4 [GDZ]: \"We glorify Thee\" (Փառաւորեմք զքեզ).\n10. Saturday. Tone 8 [DK]. Of the Holy Council of Ephesus of the two hundred Patriarchs.\n11. Sunday. Tone 1 [ADZ]. Third [Sunday]. Fathers [Hymn] Tone 6 [GK]: \"Ineffable\" (Անճառելի). Dismissal Hymn [Hambartsi] Tone 1 [ADZ]: \"Glory of the Resurrection\" (Փաոք յարութեան). Barekendan of the Fast of the Assumption of the Mother of God.\n12. Monday. Tone 2 [AK]. Fast of the Holy Mother of God. Fathers [Hymn] Tone 2 [AK]: \"The ineffable essence\" (Զանճառ էութիւն).\n18. Sunday. Tone 8 [DK]. Assumption of the Holy Mother of God. The privilege of eating meat is three weeks. See according to the order in the First Volume.\nSeptember\n[September] 8. Sunday. Tone 4 [GDZ]. Fourth [Sunday]. Feast of the Nativity of the Mother of God from Anna. Barekendan of the Holy Cross.\n9. Monday. Tone 6 [GK]. Fast of the Holy Cross. Fathers [Hymn] Tone 3 [BK]: \"God of our fathers\" (Որ հարցն մերոց աստուած).\n15. Sunday. Tone 3 [BK]. Exaltation of the Holy Cross [Khachverats]. Until the tenth Sunday see according to the order in the First Volume, keeping the order of this letter.\n[September] 22. Sunday. Tone 2 [BDZ]. Second [Sunday]. Dismissal Hymn [Hambartsi] Tone 2 [BDZ]: \"In the tomb\" (Ի գերեզման) and \"They came to the tomb\" (Եկին ի գերեզման). Barekendan of the Cross of Varag.\n23. Monday. Tone 3 [BK]. Fast. Saint Mamas, etc. Fathers [Hymn] Tone 7 [DZ]: \"The hopeful ones\" (Յուսացեալքն).\n[September] 25. Wednesday. Tone 6 [GK]. Fathers [Hymn] Tone 7 [DZ]: \"Glorified is Thy name forever, O God\" (Փառաւորեալ անուն քո յաւիտեան աստուած).\n29. Sunday. Tone 2 [AK]. Third [Sunday]. Feast of the Cross of Varag. The privilege of eating meat is seven weeks.\nOctober\n6. Sunday. Tone 1 [ADZ]. Fourth [Sunday]. Dismissal Hymn [Hambartsi] Tone 1 [ADZ]: \"With the women\" (Ընդ կանայսն).\n13. Sunday. Tone 8 [DK]. Fifth [Sunday]. Dismissal Hymn [Hambartsi] Tone 8 [DK]: \"When they came\" (Յորժամ եկին), and \"The angel descended\" (Էջ հրեշտակն), and \"The ranks of angels\" (Հրեշտակացն դասք).",
